    "[Transcriber note] Two tiers, laid out as stacked sections: PREMIUM ($45.95/person) lists P1-P28; SUPREME ($57.95/person) is printed as 'Includes all PREMIUM plus:' S29-S32, i.e. Supreme = P1-P28 + S29-S32. APPETIZERS & STEWS (A1-A13) are listed once below both tiers with no price and no tier marker. The footnotes '(*) Limit 1 per person' / '(**) Limit 2 per person.' are printed directly under S31/S32 and are copied to fineprint. Rules lines above are printed at the bottom-left of the menu above the fine print.",
    "[Transcriber note] Tags reflect printed markers only: 'best seller' = red BEST SELLER starburst badge; 'spicy' = one chili-pepper icon; 'spicy x2' = two chili-pepper icons printed; 'vegetarian' = sprout icon. Item names are printed in all caps on the menu and kept that way here. 'number' is the printed item code.",
